# P49 through GtkBackend: the cover and the comparison sheet closed by their Close buttons (programmatic),
# then the sheet by Escape (the user). The main view must end on "cover opens: 1, dismissals: 1, sheet
# dismissals: 2". GtkBackend has run onDismiss on both paths since c1138e51 (2026-09-08); the AppKit twin
# is P49-close-the-cover.actions. By label, so no point depends on the GTK layout.
#
# The sheet's Close is a point in the MAIN window's frame, not a taplabel: on macOS a GTK sheet is a child
# window, AppKitSynthesiser.targetWindow() skips child windows (so a popover is not taken for the driven
# window), and a label found in the sheet was offset from the main window's corner -- it pressed beside the
# sheet. The cover lies exactly over the main window, so its taplabel lands.
# The focus rows put the main window back in front after a sheet closes: on macOS a GTK window that has
# just lost its sheet did not take the next click, and "Show the sheet" pressed nothing (2026-10-20).
# P49 經 GtkBackend:以 Close 關 cover 與 sheet(程式),再以 Escape 關 sheet(使用者)。最後必須是 1/1 與 sheet 計數 2。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P49 render,macos,
taplabel,,,,,Show the cover,,cover opens 0 -> 1,macos,
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,macos,
taplabel,,,,,Close,,"the cover's Close: dismissals 0 -> 1",macos,
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,macos,
focus,,,,,,,the main window again,macos,P49 presentations
taplabel,,,,,Show the sheet,,the comparison sheet,macos,
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,macos,
